{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "f0ef482cdca2a6157ae64441f4194bcfa21dce1a356868dabe9649c22f6b3df7",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0001",
      "text": "Batch Transfers Bypass KYC Verification Completely",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 50,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0002",
      "text": "## Vulnerability Details",
      "start": 52,
      "end": 76,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0003",
      "text": "The `WERC7575ShareToken` contract implements KYC requirements for all token recipients in standard ERC-20 operations:",
      "start": 78,
      "end": 195,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0004",
      "text": "**KYC Protected Functions:**",
      "start": 197,
      "end": 225,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0005",
      "text": "- `mint()` - Line 363: `if (!isKycVerified[to]) revert KycRequired();`",
      "start": 226,
      "end": 296,
      "line": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0006",
      "text": "- `transfer()` - Line 474: `if (!isKycVerified[to]) revert KycRequired();`",
      "start": 297,
      "end": 371,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0007",
      "text": "- `transferFrom()` - Line 489: `if (!isKycVerified[to]) revert KycRequired();`",
      "start": 374,
      "end": 452,
      "line": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0008",
      "text": "However, the batch transfer functions completely bypass this critical security control:",
      "start": 454,
      "end": 541,
      "line": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0009",
      "text": "**KYC Bypass Functions:**",
      "start": 543,
      "end": 568,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0010",
      "text": "- `batchTransfers()` - Line 700: **NO KYC CHECK**",
      "start": 569,
      "end": 618,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0011",
      "text": "- `rBatchTransfers()` - Line 1119: **NO KYC CHECK**",
      "start": 619,
      "end": 670,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0012",
      "text": "Both batch functions update `_balances` for creditors (recipients) without verifying their KYC status. This creates a complete bypass of the platform's regulatory compliance controls.",
      "start": 672,
      "end": 855,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0013",
      "text": "### Root Cause",
      "start": 857,
      "end": 871,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0014",
      "text": "The batch transfer functions directly manipulate the internal `_balances` mapping without calling the standard transfer functions that include KYC checks. The validator (a trusted but potentially compromised role) can send tokens to ANY address, regardless of KYC status.",
      "start": 872,
      "end": 1143,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0015",
      "text": "### Attack Scenarios",
      "start": 1145,
      "end": 1165,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0016",
      "text": "**Scenario 1: Compromised Validator Key**",
      "start": 1167,
      "end": 1208,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0017",
      "text": "1. Attacker compromises validator private key",
      "start": 1209,
      "end": 1254,
      "line": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0018",
      "text": "2. Calls `batchTransfers()` to send tokens to sanctioned addresses",
      "start": 1255,
      "end": 1321,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0019",
      "text": "3. Bypasses all KYC controls completely",
      "start": 1322,
      "end": 1361,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0020",
      "text": "4. Platform unknowingly facilitates transactions to sanctioned entities",
      "start": 1362,
      "end": 1433,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0021",
      "text": "**Scenario 2: Malicious Insider**",
      "start": 1435,
      "end": 1468,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0022",
      "text": "1. Malicious validator/insider uses `batchTransfers()`",
      "start": 1469,
      "end": 1523,
      "line": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0023",
      "text": "2. Sends tokens to non-KYC'd addresses for money laundering",
      "start": 1524,
      "end": 1583,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0024",
      "text": "3. No audit trail of KYC violations",
      "start": 1584,
      "end": 1619,
      "line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0025",
      "text": "4. Platform faces regulatory action",
      "start": 1620,
      "end": 1655,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0026",
      "text": "**Scenario 3: Regulatory Compliance Failure**",
      "start": 1657,
      "end": 1702,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0027",
      "text": "1. Even legitimate batch operations can violate compliance",
      "start": 1703,
      "end": 1761,
      "line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0028",
      "text": "2. If validator mistakenly includes non-KYC'd address",
      "start": 1762,
      "end": 1815,
      "line": 39
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0029",
      "text": "3. Platform automatically violates regulatory requirements",
      "start": 1816,
      "end": 1874,
      "line": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0030",
      "text": "4. No prevention mechanism exists",
      "start": 1875,
      "end": 1908,
      "line": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0031",
      "text": "### Impact",
      "start": 1910,
      "end": 1920,
      "line": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0032",
      "text": "**Direct Security Impact:**",
      "start": 1922,
      "end": 1949,
      "line": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0033",
      "text": "- Complete bypass of KYC-based access control",
      "start": 1950,
      "end": 1995,
      "line": 46
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0034",
      "text": "- Sanctioned/blacklisted entities can receive tokens",
      "start": 1996,
      "end": 2048,
      "line": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0035",
      "text": "- Money laundering vector created",
      "start": 2049,
      "end": 2082,
      "line": 48
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0036",
      "text": "- Regulatory compliance completely broken",
      "start": 2083,
      "end": 2124,
      "line": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0037",
      "text": "**Platform-Level Risks:**",
      "start": 2126,
      "end": 2151,
      "line": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0038",
      "text": "- Platform shutdown by regulators",
      "start": 2152,
      "end": 2185,
      "line": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0039",
      "text": "- Criminal investigation for AML violations",
      "start": 2186,
      "end": 2229,
      "line": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0040",
      "text": "- Loss of operating licenses",
      "start": 2230,
      "end": 2258,
      "line": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0041",
      "text": "- Massive legal/financial penalties",
      "start": 2259,
      "end": 2294,
      "line": 55
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0042",
      "text": "- Reputational destruction",
      "start": 2295,
      "end": 2321,
      "line": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0043",
      "text": "**Business Continuity:**",
      "start": 2323,
      "end": 2347,
      "line": 58
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0044",
      "text": "- Even if validator is trustworthy, compromised key = instant regulatory violation",
      "start": 2348,
      "end": 2430,
      "line": 59
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0045",
      "text": "- No technical safeguard against accidental or malicious KYC bypass",
      "start": 2431,
      "end": 2498,
      "line": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "e_f0ef482cdca2_0046",
      "text": "- Single point of failure for entire compliance framework",
      "start": 2499,
      "end": 2556,
      "line": 61
    }
  ]
}
